  m_text: "Captain\u2019s Orders\n\nThe Captain is the head of the ship, so when
    he talks, you listen. He\u2019ll tell you what to do, and will guide you throughout
    the journey. \n\nYour objective will appear in the top left of the screen, and
    can be checked any time in the pause menu by pressing [ESC]."
