  m_text: "Take Inventory\n\nIf the Captain needs something, you better get it. \n\nTo
    interact with anything, press [E] when it\u2019s nearby. An object will be interactable
    when a pop-up appears.\n\nIf you interact and pick up an object, it will appear
    in the bottom right corner of the screen, disappearing upon use."
