  m_text: "Don't Shoot Like a Bum\n\nYou\u2019re only so strong, and there are only
    so many harpoons you can lug around with ya'. Keep an eye on your ammo count
    under the reticle, cuz\u2019 when you're out, you\u2019re screwed until you find
    more. \n\nInteract with ammo racks around the ship to refill your supply."
