  m_text: "Protect Yourself\n\nYou never know what might happen in the bayou, so
    you\u2019d best be ready for trouble. \n\nTo use your harpoon gun, first aim
    by holding down the right mouse button, and then you can fire with the left.
    The longer you hold your aim, the more focused your accuracy will be. "
